ss.\n\nLet's enumerate.\n\nFirst, list all singleton rows for each element:\n\nElement 0: rows 2,10 (two options)\nElement 1: row 3 (only one)\nElement 2: rows 4,6 (two options)\nElement 3: row 8 (only one)\nElement 4: rows 5,7 (two options)\n\nAlso pair rows:\n\n- {2,3}: row 0\n- {0,1}: row 1\n- {3,4}: row 9\n\nAlso note that there are no other pairs.\n\nNow, we need to consider combinations.\n\nCase A: 5 singletons: choose one row for each element. For element 0 choose from 2 options, element1 only 1, element2 2 options, element3 1, element4 2 options. So number of ways = 2*1*2*1*2 = 8"}}],"created":1790942564,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4185,"total_tokens":4953,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-kjDCVJsItxjOAglOeFdsoI53z2Y28sLb","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4185,"prompt_ms":539.627,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12894313022700118,"prompt_per_second":7755.356940998135,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2403.533,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.133680573663624,"predicted_per_second":319.1135715631947}}